WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.846
Most jobs go to someone the hiring manager

2
00:00:02.846 --> 00:00:04.257
has already talked to.

3
00:00:04.257 --> 00:00:06.590
Junior gets you into that conversation.

4
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.665
Tell it what you do,

5
00:00:08.665 --> 00:00:09.920
where you want to work,

6
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:10.942
and how you sound.

7
00:00:10.942 --> 00:00:11.918
That's the setup.

8
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.341
Junior reads hiring posts on LinkedIn,

9
00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:19.209
picks the ones worth your time,

10
00:00:19.209 --> 00:00:21.290
and writes a comment in your voice.

11
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:22.357
Not a bot reply.

12
00:00:22.357 --> 00:00:24.972
The kind of comment a hiring manager actually

13
00:00:24.972 --> 00:00:25.612
answers.

14
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:31.753
You see every comment it posted,

15
00:00:31.753 --> 00:00:33.128
every post it skipped,

16
00:00:33.128 --> 00:00:33.762
and why.

17
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.603
Add the companies you want to work at.

18
00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.015
Junior follows their people,

19
00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:40.736
shows you what each comment earned,

20
00:00:40.736 --> 00:00:42.457
and tells you who to follow up with

21
00:00:42.457 --> 00:00:42.854
next.

22
00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.771
When someone writes back,

23
00:00:46.771 --> 00:00:48.225
it lands in one inbox,

24
00:00:48.225 --> 00:00:50.070
with a reply already drafted.

25
00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.448
And it still takes care of Easy Apply

26
00:00:53.448 --> 00:00:54.830
jobs in the background.

27
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.214
Less applying into the void.

28
00:00:57.214 --> 00:00:59.914
More conversations that turn into interviews.

29
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:03.054
Junior. Start at heyjunior.ai
